<title>AUSTRIA: Austria February c/a deficit at 3.5 bln ATS.</title>
<headline>Austria February c/a deficit at 3.5 bln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank reported the following economic indicator details. AUSTRIAN CURRENT ACCOUNT (in billions of schillings)</p>
<p>				    FEBRUARY    JANUARY	FEB 96</p>
<p> Current account balance ATS  -3.5	  0.7	    4.8</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance    -6.6	 -8.7	   -6.5</p>
<p> Exports			    58.2	 63.5	   57.8</p>
<p> Imports			    64.8	 72.2	   64.2</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE FIGURES	     JAN-FEB 97 JAN-FEB 96</p>
<p> Current account balance ATS  -2.8	 11.1</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance   -15.2	 -7.4</p>
<p> Exports			   121.8	126.6</p>
<p> Imports			   137.0	134.0</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
